  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="29a4b35a-c3b2-506a-8ad9-9b37ee359d85" activityNameId="5642bd48-41ed-5738-9a6e-a1697c91a90e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Exhaust air system for kitchen in appartment buildings</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Exhaust air system for kitchen in appartment buildings
Production of a exhaust air system for kitchens in appartment buildings. The reference value of the inventory is 1 m2 heated gross floor area. The inventory is an estimate based on a study of an exhaust air system for kitchen and bathrooms of one large appartment building with a heated gross floor area of 30800 m2.The inventory includes materials needed for fans and ducts. The data represents ductwork mainly made of galvanized steel. It includes duct fans and radial fans without heat recovery and a nominal air flow rate of 500-5700 m3/h per unit.;
UUID: 84800d40-3065-39de-87ac-e0b3ef2f3eb9
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the production and processing of the raw materials. No infrastructure of the production site and no transports of raw materials included.
Location: Data sources from one building in Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for ventilation systems in appartment buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 1998. Process information partly from 1998 to 2008
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from one specific building from literature and assumptions 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_84800d40-3065-39de-87ac-e0b3ef2f3eb9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
